cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline or the released runs, please cite it as below."
title: "persona-emotions: emotion steering vectors for open LLMs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mamarin
    given-names: Georgy
repository-code: "https://github.com/dmagog/persona-emotions"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for extracting and evaluating emotion steering vectors
  (7 ISEAR emotions) in open instruct LLMs via contrastive activation
  steering, with a cross-model specificity protocol, a three-judge
  LLM evaluation panel and per-artifact protocol stamps for
  reproducibility. Includes released runs for 11 models across 6
  model families.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Persona Vectors: Monitoring and Controlling Character Traits in Language Models"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.21509"
